# ==============================================================================
# [PROJECT NEXUS ENGINE] Unified .gitignore
# Server (C++) + Client (Unity)
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ✅ [Visual Studio & C++ Server Core]
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.ipch
*.pch
*.obj
*.idb
*.opendb
*.tlog
*.ilk
*.log
*.cache
*.lastbuildstate
*.FileListAbsolute.txt

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ✅ [Compiler Output] (바이너리 절대 금지)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.exe
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb

# [CRITICAL] Unity Plugins 예외 처리
# 기본적으로 *.dll은 무시하지만, 유니티 Assets 폴더 안의 dll(플러그인)은 올려야 함.
*.dll
!Assets/**/Plugins/**/*.dll
!**/Assets/Plugins/**/*.dll

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ✅ [Temporary / Generated Files]
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.ipdb
*.iobj
*.recipe

# [Server Config] (보안상 로컬에만 두는 설정 파일)
ServerConfig.json

# [Build Folders]
Debug/
Release/
x64/
ARM64/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ✅ [Python Tools]
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.spec
build/
dist/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ✅ [NuGet]
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
packages/

# ==============================================================================
# ✅ [UNITY CLIENT SPECIAL] (여기가 핵심이다)
# ==============================================================================

# [Unity System Generated] - 절대 올리지 마라. 용량 폭발의 주범.
/Project/MmoNexusServerEngine/IocpChatServer/Client/[Ll]ibrary/
/Project/MmoNexusServerEngine/IocpChatServer/Client/[Tt]emp/
/Project/MmoNexusServerEngine/IocpChatServer/Client/[Oo]bj/
/Project/MmoNexusServerEngine/IocpChatServer/Client/[Bb]uild/
/Project/MmoNexusServerEngine/IocpChatServer/Client/[Bb]uilds/
/Project/MmoNexusServerEngine/IocpChatServer/Client/[Ll]ogs/
/Project/MmoNexusServerEngine/IocpChatServer/Client/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/

# [Unity IDE Generated] - VS/Rider가 생성하는 껍데기 파일들
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.tmp
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
